                <h2>适用场景与前置条件</h2>
<p>本 SOP 适用于 TikTok Shop 美区/英区新品上架后的前 4 周冷启动阶段，运营团队需在正式投放前完成素材池搭建。执行前提：</p>
<ul>
<li>产品已通过 TikTok Shop 商品审核</li>
<li>目标受众画像已明确</li>
<li>投放预算已审批</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>Step 1 | 明确素材需求清单</h2>
<p>在动手拍摄前，先用一张表格理清“需要什么”。建议按以下维度展开：</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>维度</th>
<th>问题</th>
<th>产出物</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>产品层面</td>
<td>核心卖点有几个？</td>
<td>卖点清单（不超过 5 个）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>用户层面</td>
<td>用户刷到视频后 3 秒内能否 get 价值？</td>
<td>钩子脚本初稿</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>平台层面</td>
<td>当前跑量的素材时长是 15s 还是 21s？</td>
<td>素材规格表</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>投放层面</td>
<td>计划测试几个广告组？每个组需要几套素材？</td>
<td>素材配额表</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>实操提示</strong>：某工具类 App 团队在冷启动时只准备了 3 条素材，结果两天就跑空了，不得不临时补拍，导致测试数据断档。建议首批素材储备量 = 计划测试组数 × 4。</p>
</blockquote>
<hr />
<h2>Step 2 | 制定素材类型矩阵</h2>
<p>不要把所有鸡蛋放在一个篮子里。冷启动阶段建议按以下比例搭建素材矩阵：</p>
<p><strong>主攻素材（占比 40%）</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>产品卖点直出型：真人出镜/画外音口播，15-21 秒</li>
<li>使用场景演示型：展示真实使用过程，突出效果对比</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>助攻素材（占比 35%）</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>痛点共鸣型：先抛出用户困扰，再引出解决方案</li>
<li>评论区互动型：预留评论区引导空间，适合问答式脚本</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>测试素材（占比 25%）</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>纯产品展示型：多角度静物拍摄，适配图文轮播</li>
<li>工厂/溯源型：展示供应链真实性，提升用户信任</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>Step 3 | 制作标准与素材库建立</h2>
<h3>3.1 拍摄标准清单</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>分辨率</strong>：1080P 以上，推荐 4K</li>
<li><strong>横纵比</strong>：优先竖屏 9:16，附带 1:1 版本备用</li>
<li><strong>光线</strong>：自然光或专业补光灯，避免逆光</li>
<li><strong>音频</strong>：环境音干净，口播需单独收音</li>
<li><strong>字幕</strong>：必须嵌入，字体大于画面高度 5%</li>
</ul>
<h3>3.2 素材命名规范</h3>
<p>采用「日期_品类_卖点关键词_版本号」格式，例如：</p>
<pre><code>20250108_skincare_hydration_A1.mp4
</code></pre>
<h3>3.3 素材库目录结构</h3>
<pre><code>├── 01_原始素材/
├── 02_剪辑版本/
│   ├── 15s/
│   ├── 21s/
│   └── 60s/
├── 03_待投放/
├── 04_已测试数据/
└── 05_废弃素材/
</code></pre>
<hr />
<h2>Step 4 | 素材测试与数据回收</h2>
<h3>4.1 测试分组策略</h3>
<p>将素材按类型分配到不同广告组，避免同类型素材互相抢量：</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>广告组</th>
<th>素材类型</th>
<th>预算分配</th>
<th>观察周期</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>AG-01</td>
<td>主攻-卖点直出</td>
<td>50%</td>
<td>3 天</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>AG-02</td>
<td>助攻-痛点共鸣</td>
<td>30%</td>
<td>3 天</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>AG-03</td>
<td>测试-纯展示</td>
<td>20%</td>
<td>5 天</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>4.2 核心数据指标</h3>
<p>每日记录以下数据：</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>CTR</strong>（点击率）：低于 1% 需立即优化封面或开头 3 秒</li>
<li><strong>CVR</strong>（转化率）：低于 0.5% 检查落地页或产品匹配度</li>
<li><strong>CPM</strong>：用于判断素材是否在有效受众中展示</li>
<li><strong>7 日 ROI</strong>：冷启动期重点关注 CAC 与首单转化</li>
</ul>
<h3>4.3 数据回收表模板</h3>
<p>建议使用在线表格（如飞书/Notion）建立共享文档，每日更新一次。字段包括：素材名称、投放日期、广告组、消耗、CTR、CVR、7 日 ROI、综合评分（1-5 分）。</p>
<hr />
<h2>Step 5 | 素材迭代与储备更新</h2>
<p>冷启动第 2 周起，根据 Step 4 数据开始迭代：</p>
<p><strong>保留</strong>：综合评分 ≥ 4 分的素材，进入常态化投放</p>
<p><strong>优化</strong>：评分 2.5-3.9 分的素材，调整开头钩子或 BGM 后重新测试</p>
<p><strong>淘汰</strong>：评分 &lt; 2.5 分的素材，移入废弃文件夹，不再复用</p>
<p>同时，根据第一周跑出的高转化卖点，及时补充新素材。建议每周新增 2-3 条，保持素材池活性。</p>
<hr />
<h2>常见问题 FAQ</h2>
<p><strong>Q：素材不够用，但预算还有怎么办？</strong></p>
<p>A：优先检查是否有素材可以剪出不同版本（不同开头、不同时长），避免临时补拍导致投放断档。</p>
<p><strong>Q：所有素材 CTR 都很低怎么办？</strong></p>
<p>A：问题大概率出在开头 3 秒或封面图，尝试更换钩子文案或重新设计缩略图。</p>
<p><strong>Q：自然流量和广告流量需要分开建素材池吗？</strong></p>
<p>A：建议分开管理，广告素材需更注重转化导向，自然流量素材可以更偏娱乐性。</p>
<hr />
<h2>执行检查清单</h2>
<p>冷启动前 1 天，运营负责人需逐项确认：</p>
<ul>
<li>[ ] 素材储备量 ≥ 计划测试组数 × 4</li>
<li>[ ] 所有素材已按命名规范归档</li>
<li>[ ] 测试分组策略已制定并告知广告投放同事</li>
<li>[ ] 数据回收表已创建并开放共享权限</li>
<li>[ ] 续量素材（高分素材的延伸版本）已纳入制作排期</li>
</ul>
            </div>
            <div class="prose max-w-none" x-show="lang === 'en'" x-cloak>
                <h2>When to Use This SOP</h2>
<p>This SOP applies to the first 4 weeks of TikTok Shop cold start for new products in US/UK markets. Prerequisites: products approved on TikTok Shop, target audience defined, and budget approved.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Step 1 | Define Asset Requirements</h2>
<p>Before shooting, clarify needs with a structured approach:</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Dimension</th>
<th>Question</th>
<th>Deliverable</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Product</td>
<td>How many core selling points?</td>
<td>List (max 5)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>User</td>
<td>Can viewers understand value within 3 seconds?</td>
<td>Hook script draft</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Platform</td>
<td>What's the optimal length: 15s or 21s?</td>
<td>Spec sheet</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Campaign</td>
<td>How many ad sets? How many assets per set?</td>
<td>Asset quota</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Tip</strong>: A home goods team prepared only 3 assets for cold start and ran out within 2 days. Recommended stock: test group count × 4.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr />
<h2>Step 2 | Build Asset Type Matrix</h2>
<p><strong>Core Assets (40%)</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Direct卖点 showcase: presenter-led, 15-21s</li>
<li>Usage scenario demo: real usage process with before/after</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Supporting Assets (35%)</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Pain point resonance: user problem → solution</li>
<li>Comment interaction: space for Q&amp;A format</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Test Assets (25%)</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Pure product showcase: multi-angle static shots for carousel</li>
<li>Factory/origin story: supply chain authenticity</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>Step 3 | Production Standards &amp; Organization</h2>
<h3>3.1 Shooting Checklist</h3>
<ul>
<li>Resolution: 1080P minimum, 4K preferred</li>
<li>Aspect ratio: 9:16 vertical priority, 1:1 backup</li>
<li>Lighting: natural or professional fill, no backlight</li>
<li>Audio: clean ambient, separate voice recording</li>
<li>Subtitles: embedded, font &gt; 5% of frame height</li>
</ul>
<h3>3.2 Naming Convention</h3>
<p><code>YYYYMMDD_Category_USP_Version.mp4</code></p>
<h3>3.3 Folder Structure</h3>
<pre><code>├── 01_Raw/
├── 02_Edited/
│   ├── 15s/
│   ├── 21s/
│   └── 60s/
├── 03_Ready/
├── 04_Tested_Data/
└── 05_Rejected/
</code></pre>
<hr />
<h2>Step 4 | Testing &amp; Data Collection</h2>
<h3>4.1 Test Group Strategy</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Ad Set</th>
<th>Asset Type</th>
<th>Budget %</th>
<th>Observation Period</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>AG-01</td>
<td>Core - Direct</td>
<td>50%</td>
<td>3 days</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>AG-02</td>
<td>Supporting - Pain</td>
<td>30%</td>
<td>3 days</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>AG-03</td>
<td>Test - Static</td>
<td>20%</td>
<td>5 days</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>4.2 Key Metrics</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>CTR</strong>: &lt; 1% needs immediate cover/hook optimization</li>
<li><strong>CVR</strong>: &lt; 0.5% check landing page or product fit</li>
<li><strong>CPM</strong>: effectiveness of audience targeting</li>
<li><strong>7-day ROI</strong>: focus on CAC and first purchase</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>Step 5 | Iteration &amp; Stock Refresh</h2>
<p><strong>Keep</strong>: Score ≥ 4 → regular rotation</p>
<p><strong>Optimize</strong>: Score 2.5-3.9 → adjust hook/BGM, retest</p>
<p><strong>Retire</strong>: Score &lt; 2.5 → archive, do not reuse</p>
<p>Add 2-3 new assets weekly based on top-converting hooks.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Quick Checklist Before Launch</h2>
<ul>
<li>[ ] Asset stock ≥ test groups × 4</li>
<li>[ ] All assets named and organized</li>
<li>[ ] Test group strategy communicated</li>
<li>[ ] Data tracking sheet created and shared</li>
<li>[ ] Follow-up assets scheduled for Week 2</li>
</ul>
